    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1064-a15">

                <pb facs="1157" n="1061" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1061"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 15 in No. 267.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_imprecise-inferred-from-document-content"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-02-17T16:26:00+00:09"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 17,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>I have just received the following telegram from the lord mayor of London:</p>
                <p>“On the part of the citizens of London, and for myself personally, I beg to
                    convey to your excellency heartfelt sympathy in the terrible calamity which has
                    befallen the American people by the loss of so many of their gallant
                    sailors.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-17T16:26:00+00:09">4.26 p.m.</date></dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
